<%- include('partials/head') %>
<section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap">
  <p class="eyebrow">How it works</p>
  <h1>From application to funding in four steps.</h1>
  <p class="lead">Here's exactly what happens after you hit "Apply."</p>
</div></section>

<section class="sec"><div class="wrap">
  <ol class="timeline">
    <li><span>1</span><div><h3>Complete the online application</h3><p>About 10 minutes. You'll share business details, the amount you're looking for, owner information and your signature.</p></div></li>
    <li><span>2</span><div><h3>Upload four months of bank statements</h3><p>Your most recent business bank statements show us how your business is performing. PDF downloads from your bank work best.</p></div></li>
    <li><span>3</span><div><h3>Review your offers with an advisor</h3><p>We review your file and present the options you qualify for — amount, term, payment schedule and total cost.</p></div></li>
    <li><span>4</span><div><h3>Sign and get funded</h3><p>Once you choose an offer and sign, funds are sent directly to your business bank account.</p></div></li>
  </ol>
  <div class="center"><a href="/apply" class="btn btn-green btn-lg">Start My Application</a></div>
</div></section>

<section class="sec sec-alt"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head"><h2>Have these ready</h2></div>
  <div class="cards cards-3">
    <article class="card plain"><h3>Business info</h3><p>Legal name, DBA, EIN, start date, address and industry.</p></article>
    <article class="card plain"><h3>Owner info</h3><p>Home address, date of birth, SSN and estimated credit score for each owner.</p></article>
    <article class="card plain"><h3>Bank statements</h3><p>Your last four months of business bank statements (PDF, JPG or PNG).</p></article>
  </div>
</div></section>
<%- include('partials/foot') %>
